      "code": "import threading, multiprocessing, asyncio\n\nt = threading.Thread(target=work)      # 线程：能并发，但受 GIL 限制\nt.start(); t.join()\n\np = multiprocessing.Process(target=work)   # 进程：真并行，各有各的内存\np.start(); p.join()\n\nasyncio.run(main())                    # 协程：单线程内的并发，不并行\n\n# ⚠ GIL：同一时刻只有一个线程在执行字节码\n#        纯计算的活开线程不会变快，要开进程\n#        IO 等待时 GIL 会释放，所以 IO 密集用线程/协程有效",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">import</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> threading</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> multiprocessing</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">,</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">t </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> threading</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">Thread</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(target</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">work)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">      # 线程：能并发，但受 GIL 限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">t</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">start</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">()</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">; t</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">join</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">p </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> multiprocessing</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">Process</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(target</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">work)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">   # 进程：真并行，各有各的内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">p</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">start</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">()</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">; p</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">join</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">asyncio</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">run</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">main</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">())</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">                    # 协程：单线程内的并发，不并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\"># ⚠ GIL：同一时刻只有一个线程在执行字节码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">#        纯计算的活开线程不会变快，要开进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">#        IO 等待时 GIL 会释放，所以 IO 密集用线程/协程有效</span></span></code></pre>",
